      "value": "@{607ce823c790be2ccf97d4a1|full_name}: By the look of it. That type of avatar have too much going on. Better have separate avatar then an all season in one. Parameter driver is God like feature for enabling or disabling other bool/change int value /etc. Abuse it at will.",
