      "value": "@{5f2def4d22470972dc58f6a2|full_name}: 13? my avatar has over 50...\na lot of those aren't just \"for looks\", they're practical toggles for things players find useful, such as mute pen and mute keyboard, flashlight (with light source), flight system, etc\nis it really too much\nI don't see how having to use multiple avatars which are the same avatar but with just different utility setups is better than simply having one that has all of them",
